1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,410
Hi, I'm an AI presenter,

2
00:00:01,410 --> 00:00:02,933
and this is SongScribe AI.

3
00:00:02,933 --> 00:00:05,465
Some moments deserve
more than a card.

4
00:00:05,465 --> 00:00:08,354
SongScribe turns your story
into an original song,

5
00:00:08,354 --> 00:00:11,626
with music, lyrics and vocals,
built from a guided brief.

6
00:00:11,626 --> 00:00:13,826
Tell its AI Producer
about a birthday,

7
00:00:13,826 --> 00:00:16,277
a wedding or someone you
miss, by chat or by voice.

8
00:00:16,277 --> 00:00:19,622
It shows the cost before
spending credits,

9
00:00:19,622 --> 00:00:23,401
then returns two
variations, typically in
thirty to sixty seconds.

10
00:00:23,401 --> 00:00:25,555
Creators use it for
intros and theme music.

11
00:00:25,555 --> 00:00:27,792
Brands use it for jingles,

12
00:00:27,792 --> 00:00:29,935
sonic logos and
campaign soundtracks.

13
00:00:29,935 --> 00:00:32,868
Genres run from acoustic and
gospel to Afrobeat and

14
00:00:32,868 --> 00:00:36,158
Amapiano, and lyrics can blend
English, pidgin and Yoruba.

15
00:00:36,158 --> 00:00:38,973
The rules are clear: no
copyrighted lyrics

16
00:00:38,973 --> 00:00:41,286
or melodies, and no
artist sound-alikes.

17
00:00:41,286 --> 00:00:44,558
Start free, then choose a
personal or commercial licence.

18
00:00:44,558 --> 00:00:46,762
Your story, turned
into a song.
